{"items":[{"id":"EUVD-2026-91473","enisaUuid":"ab1efb1e-2bb0-30e9-8ac9-752deb333601","description":"YesWiki before 4.6.7 contains an SQL injection vulnerability in the Bazar nuagetag action, which concatenates the unescaped tags attribute into a raw SQL IN clause. Attackers with page-write access (unauthenticated on default installs) can embed a nuagetag tag ending in a backslash to break quote parity and inject a UNION subquery, exfiltrating password hashes and arbitrary table data.","datePublished":"Oct 2, 2026, 11:38:30 AM","dateUpdated":"Oct 2, 2026, 2:06:21 PM","baseScore":8.8,"baseScoreVersion":"4.0","baseScoreVector":"CVSS:4.0/AV:N/AC:L/AT:N/PR:N/UI:N/VC:H/VI:L/VA:L/SC:N/SI:N/SA:N","references":"https://github.com/YesWiki/yeswiki/security/advisories/GHSA-p9rm-p6pp-8m8c\nhttps://www.vulncheck.com/advisories/yeswiki-before-4.6.7-sql-injection-via-nuagetag-tags-parameter\n","aliases":"CVE-2026-104462\nGHSA-mvpf-2445-p988\n","assigner":"VulnCheck","epss":0.31,"enisaIdProduct":[{"id":"262ac604-8d4e-34db-81d9-d827fc3ba6fe","product":{"name":"yeswiki","vendor":{"name":"YesWiki"}},"product_version":"0 \u003c4.6.7"}],"enisaIdVendor":[{"id":"b681a658-eafc-3bec-ac9b-b3ad082cc12f","vendor":{"name":"YesWiki"}}]},{"id":"EUVD-2026-91398","enisaUuid":"4bea1f0f-02f8-34b8-b59e-309f6b7985ee","description":"Uncaught exception, Loop with unreachable exit condition (\u0027infinite loop\u0027), Integer underflow (wrap or wraparound) vulnerability in Apache Thrift D language bindings.\n\n\n\nThis issue affects Apache Thrift: before 0.25.0.\n\n\n\nUsers are recommended to upgrade to version 0.25.0, which fixes the issue.","datePublished":"Oct 2, 2026, 11:40:51 AM","dateUpdated":"Oct 2, 2026, 2:02:10 PM","baseScore":8.7,"baseScoreVersion":"4.0","baseScoreVector":"CVSS:4.0/AV:N/AC:L/AT:N/PR:N/UI:N/VC:N/VI:N/VA:H/SC:N/SI:N/SA:N","references":"https://lists.apache.org/thread/33otcgbqd27wf6qq810q56znzbomnhg1\nhttps://lists.apache.org/thread/k14jfr1xwc0vtmm2s7xro6lt7q4y6s7m\n","aliases":"G